<title>AUSTRIA: Saudi minister says OPEC agreement &quot;excellent&quot;.</title>
<headline>Saudi minister says OPEC agreement &quot;excellent&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saudi Arabian oil minister Ali bin Ibrahim al-Nuaimi said he thought OPEC's six month output rollover agreement was &quot;excellent.&quot; Venezuelan oil minister Erwin Jose Arrieta</p>
</text>
